    "name_raw": "Blighted Critical",
    "definition_type_raw": "Critical",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Roleplaying Game: Ultimate Magic",
    "definition_raw": "With a critical hit from a spell or spell-like ability, you give the target a minor spellblight.\n\nPrerequisites: Caster level 5th.\n\nBenefit: Whenever you confirm a critical hit with a touch spell, ranged touch spell, or spell-like ability against an opponent, the victim gains a random minor spellblight.\n\nSpecial: You can apply the effects of only one critical feat to a given critical hit unless you possess Critical Mastery.",
